    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32960" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκτᾰτικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>given to lengthening,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀθηναῖοι ἐ. τῶν φωνηέντων</span>”
